title: C2S4
---
Scientist A: It looks like the whole thing is about to blow! 
Scientist A: What the hell happened?
Scientist B: There were some malfunctions in the coolant pipes and in the ventilation matrix.
Scientist A: Can we initiate the shutdown protocol?
Scientist B: We’ve been trying but, we can’t contact the termination division,
Scientist B: and they’re the only ones with the code to the terminal and the shutdown program.
Scientist A: Shit, this is NOT good. We’ve got to get out of here. Tell the site to evacuate!
